DESCRIPTION:After having a #1 blues song in Australia\, Alex Bowen landed b
 ack on the scene in 2020 with his popular single ‘I Believed In Us’\, 
 which took him back on the road selling out National Australian tours and 
 quickly became a notable voice on the Australian scene. Born and raised in
  the rock and blues scene of Newcastle Australia\, he now resides on the G
 old Coast\, producing his flavour of Singer-Songwriter/Americana/Indie-Pop
  from his home studio. Encompassing a raw honest voice\, and a vocal range
  likened to Bruce Springsteen\, James Bay & Kings Of Leon. His preferred s
 tyle is Chris Stapleton\, Michael Jackson\, Diesel\, John Mayer etc. makin
 g this a show not to be missed
LOCATION:Juniors\, Cnr Fraser Dr &\, Leisure Dr\, Banora Point NSW 2486\, A
 ustralia
